<template>
  <div class="page-wrap">
    <div class="page-head animate-slide-in-up"><div><span class="eyebrow">{{ eyebrow }}</span><h1>今天，也从一小步开始</h1><p>{{ hello }}，{{ nickname }}。把计划变成一次轻松的行动。</p></div><BaseButton @click="router.push('/plan')">查看本周计划</BaseButton></div>
    <RouterLink v-if="!store.hasProfile" to="/onboarding" class="setup animate-slide-in-up" style="animation-delay:120ms">
      <span class="setup-ic"><Sparkles :size="18" /></span>
      <span class="setup-txt"><strong>还没完成建档</strong><small>花一分钟填几项，概览的称呼与"为什么适合你"才会按你的情况来。</small></span>
      <em>去建档 <ArrowRight :size="14" /></em>
    </RouterLink>
    <section class="hero" v-if="store.isPublicMode"><div><span class="hero-kicker">今日训练 · 20 MIN</span><h2>无器材基础体能</h2><p>宿舍 · 无器材 · 无跳跃</p><div class="hero-actions"><BaseButton :icon="Play" @click="start('坐站训练')">开始跟练</BaseButton><BaseButton variant="secondary" :icon="SlidersHorizontal" @click="router.push('/plan')">调整条件</BaseButton></div></div><div class="hero-orb"><Activity :size="38"/><strong>{{ weekValue }}</strong><span>本周完成</span></div></section>
    <section class="hero athlete" v-else><div><span class="hero-kicker">基础准备期 · WEEK 2 / 4</span><h2>跑步专项训练台</h2><p>保持节奏，完成今天的轻松跑。</p><div class="hero-actions"><BaseButton :icon="PlayCircle" @click="start('站姿弯举')">记录实际训练</BaseButton><BaseButton variant="secondary" :icon="GitCompare" @click="router.push('/plan')">查看调整建议</BaseButton></div></div><div class="hero-orb"><TrendingUp :size="38"/><strong>{{ loadValue }}</strong><span>本周负荷</span></div></section>
    <div class="metrics"><MetricCard class="animate-slide-in-up" style="animation-delay:240ms" label="本周训练完成" :value="weekValue" hint="有记录 / 计划场次" :icon="CheckCircle2"/><MetricCard class="animate-slide-in-up" style="animation-delay:310ms" label="今日可用时间" value="20 分钟" hint="适合轻量训练" :icon="Clock3" accent="blue"/><MetricCard class="animate-slide-in-up" style="animation-delay:380ms" :label="mealLabel" :value="mealValue" :hint="mealHint" :icon="Utensils" accent="purple"/><MetricCard class="animate-slide-in-up" style="animation-delay:450ms" label="当前目标" :value="store.isAthleteMode ? '基础准备' : '基础体能'" hint="查看目标说明" :icon="Target" accent="orange"/></div>
    <div class="grid"><BaseCard class="today animate-slide-in-up" style="animation-delay:520ms"><div class="card-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">TODAY'S SESSION</span><h3>今天的训练</h3></div><StatusBadge variant="info">待完成</StatusBadge></div><div class="session-row" v-for="s in sessionItems" :key="s.name"><div class="session-icon"><component :is="s.icon" :size="18"/></div><div><strong>{{s.name}}</strong><small>{{s.detail}}</small></div><span class="duration">{{s.duration}}</span></div><div class="card-actions"><BaseButton :icon="Play" @click="start('坐站训练')">开始训练</BaseButton><BaseButton variant="secondary" :icon="MoreHorizontal" @click="router.push('/plan')">查看详情</BaseButton></div></BaseCard><BaseCard class="meal-card animate-slide-in-up" style="animation-delay:590ms"><div class="card-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">MEAL LOG</span><h3>饮食记录</h3></div><StatusBadge :variant="mealBadgeVariant">{{ mealBadge }}</StatusBadge></div><div class="meal-progress"><div class="ring" :style="ringStyle"><strong>{{ mealSummary.recorded }}</strong><span>/ {{ mealSummary.planned }}</span></div><div><strong>{{ mealTitle }}</strong><p>{{ mealLine }}</p><RouterLink to="/meals" class="meal-link">{{ mealSummary.recorded ? '补记或修改' : '去记录' }} <ArrowRight :size="14"/></RouterLink></div></div><div class="notice">没记录的餐次只显示"未记录"，不会被判断成"没有吃"。</div></BaseCard></div>
